      "text": "Chapter I. What is MCP ?",
      "fontSize": 69.91545836986481,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chapter I. What is MCP ?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "q4ggq0nCOunuTgjleyVJL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -156.99247432372067,
      "y": 815.3339639108144,
      "width": 1267.8837890625,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 463617599,
      "version": 714,
      "versionNonce": 862168177,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775722611872,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. MCP host \n\n Is the primary AI application or environment such as Claude DeskTop,\n an AI powered IDE (eg: Cursor), or custom AI agent that utilizes the \nModel Context Protocol to connect to external data and Tools.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. MCP host \n\n Is the primary AI application or environment such as Claude DeskTop,\n an AI powered IDE (eg: Cursor), or custom AI agent that utilizes the \nModel Context Protocol to connect to external data and Tools.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "SEhc15yxGzFeEAXaGlyvW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -162.8429875726215,
      "y": 1129.2628937543432,
      "width": 1250.2796630859375,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1449008735,
      "version": 740,
      "versionNonce": 1634457375,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775722611872,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. MCP client \n\nIs a specific component inside the MCP host or code that maintains\nthe connection to a server, the Next.js app itself is the host because \nit provides the overall context and UI",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. MCP client \n\nIs a specific component inside the MCP host or code that maintains\nthe connection to a server, the Next.js app itself is the host because \nit provides the overall context and UI",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
