      "text": "3. MCP Server \n\nThis is the middleman that connects an AI model to an external system\n like PostgreSQL, Google Drive, or an API.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. MCP Server \n\nThis is the middleman that connects an AI model to an external system\n like PostgreSQL, Google Drive, or an API.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
